{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "adr-flight-delay-demo",
		"name": "Flight Delay Demo — Autonomous Disruption Recovery",
		"description": "Complete Postman collection for the ADR Flight Delay Demo.\n\n**Part A — REST API Testing (Sections 1–6)**\nDirect REST calls to backend services. Run in order:\n1. Verify seed data → 2. Report delay → 3. Test individual services → 4. Trigger full ADR recovery → 5. Verify results → 6. Additional scenarios\n\n**Part B — Customer Service MCP Testing (Sections 7–11)**\nMCP tool calls via APIM gateway (generate-from-api). Two MCP servers:\n• CustomerServiceDisruptionMCP (4 tools) at /cs-disruption-mcp/1.0.0/mcp\n• CustomerServicePassengerMCP (10 tools) at /cs-passenger-mcp/1.0.0/mcp\n\nRun create_customer_service_mcp.sh to provision the MCP servers before using Part B.\n\nThe key demo endpoint is POST /adr/recover — this triggers the full multi-service recovery negotiation.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "disruption_host",
			"value": "http://localhost:9090"
		},
		{
			"key": "crew_host",
			"value": "http://localhost:9091"
		},
		{
			"key": "passenger_host",
			"value": "http://localhost:9092"
		},
		{
			"key": "logistics_host",
			"value": "http://localhost:9093"
		},
		{
			"key": "orchestrator_host",
			"value": "http://localhost:9094"
		},
		{
			"key": "apim_host",
			"value": "https://localhost:9446"
		},
		{
			"key": "gateway_http",
			"value": "http://localhost:8283"
		},
		{
			"key": "gateway_https",
			"value": "https://localhost:8246"
		},
		{
			"key": "disruption_mcp_context",
			"value": "/cs-disruption-mcp/1.0.0/mcp"
		},
		{
			"key": "passenger_mcp_context",
			"value": "/cs-passenger-mcp/1.0.0/mcp"
		},
		{
			"key": "consumer_key",
			"value": "REPLACE_WITH_CONSUMER_KEY"
		},
		{
			"key": "consumer_secret",
			"value": "REPLACE_WITH_CONSUMER_SECRET"
		},
		{
			"key": "access_token",
			"value": ""
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Verify Seed Data",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "1.1 Get All Flights",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{disruption_host}}/disruption/flights",
							"host": [
								"{{disruption_host}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"disruption",
								"flights"
							]
						},
						"description": "List all flights in the system. Should return 7 pre-seeded flights."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "1.2 Get Flight FL001 (BA256 LHR→JFK)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{disruption_host}}/disruption/flights/FL001",
							"host": [
								"{{disruption_host}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"disruption",
								"flights",
								"FL001"
							]
						},
						"description": "Get details of flight BA256 (Boeing 777, 312 passengers, LHR→JFK). This is the flight we will delay."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "1.3 Get All Crew Members",
